sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Browser UI
  participant API as FastAPI route
  participant JWT as JWT dependency
  participant DB as SQLAlchemy
  participant SVC as Service layer
  UI->>API: Send authenticated request
  API->>JWT: Validate access token
  JWT->>DB: Resolve user
  API->>DB: Check ownership and persist state
  API->>SVC: Execute requested operation
  SVC-->>API: Result or explicit error
  API-->>UI: JSON or streaming response
